tick  5: n2 fails, chain is now [n1, n3]
tick  5: write 3 acknowledged
tick  5: n1:3 n3:3        read at tail -> x=3
tick  6: n1:4 n3:3        read at tail -> x=3
tick  7: write 4 acknowledged
tick  7: n1:4 n3:4        read at tail -> x=4
tick  8: n1:4 n3:4        read at tail -> x=4
tick  9: n1:4 n3:4        read at tail -> x=4
tick 10: n1:4 n3:4        read at tail -> x=4
